{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19954","headline":"同年春燕 · 孟郊","name":"同年春燕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年三十士，嘉会良在兹。\n高歌摇春风，醉舞摧花枝。\n意荡晼晚景，喜凝芳菲时。\n马迹攒騕褭，乐声韵参差。\n视听改旧趣，物象含新姿。\n红雨花上滴，绿烟柳际垂。\n淹中讲精义，南皮献清词。\n前贤与今人，千载爲一期。\n明鉴有皎洁，澄玉无磷缁。\n永与沙泥别，各整云汉仪。\n盛气自中积，英名日四驰。\n塞鸿绝俦匹，海月难等夷。\n郁抑忽已尽，亲朋乐无涯。\n幽蘅发空曲，芳杜绵所思。\n浮迹自聚散，壮心谁别离。\n愿保金石志，无令有夺移。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}